<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107632" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρκειμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie above,</i>
			esp. of place, <i>to be placed</i> or <i>situated above</i> or
				<i>beyond,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ὑπερκείμενοι τῆς Μακεδονίας
					βάρβαροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.29.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.44.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				9.5.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὀφρὺς ὑ. τοῦ ὄμματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.Jun.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.8
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.344
			</span></i>, al.: rarely c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν τινι ὑ. αὐτοῖς νησιδίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					832a23
				</span></i>
			:abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; mostly in part., <i>lying</i> or
				<i>situated above,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὑπερκειμένη χώρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.163
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὑ. κρημνῶν</span>”
				<i>overhanging,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.30.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>to be placed above</i> (in rank), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ
				-μενος [δαίμων</span>] <i>superior,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.4.3
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				56
			</span></i>; <i>transcend,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς διακρίσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					164
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>excel,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				16.47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πρᾶσιν ὑπερκείμενα</span>
			<i>put up</i> for sale, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PAmh.</u>
				2.97.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, restd. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGen.</u>
				5.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>to be delayed, postponed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς εἰς τὸ τρίτον ἔτος
				ὑπερκειμένας</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρτάβας</span>) <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1760.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτίθημι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
